## 重要说明：我无法创建文件

我当前是一个**只读的代码探索助手**。系统已强制禁用了所有写入、编辑、创建目录和执行命令的工具，我**只能**使用以下只读工具：

- `ls` — 列出目录
- `read_file` — 读取文件
- `glob` — 按文件名搜索
- `grep` — 按内容搜索

因此，我**无法**在 D 盘创建目录、无法创建 HTML/JS 文件、也无法运行游戏。这与您请求中的"创建一个新目录并创建文件"直接冲突。

## 我能为您做的

我可以为您**提供完整的、可直接复制粘贴的代码**，您只需在 D 盘手动创建目录和文件即可。以下是完整的俄罗斯方块实现方案。

---

## 文件结构

在 `D:\tetris\` 目录下创建两个文件：

```
D:\tetris\
├── index.html
└── game.js
```

---

## 1. `index.html`

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>俄罗斯方块 Tetris</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
      font-family: "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      color: #eaeaea;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .game-container {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 24px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    /* 游戏主区域 */
    #board {
      display: block;
      background: #0f0f1a;
      border: 3px solid #2d2d44;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
    }

    /* 侧边面板 */
    .sidebar {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
      width: 180px;
    }

    .panel {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid #2d2d44;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 14px;
    }

    .panel h2 {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #7f8fa6;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    /* 计分板 */
    .score-value {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #4ecca3;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(78, 204, 163, 0.5);
    }

    .stat-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 14px;
      padding: 4px 0;
      color: #b8c1cc;
    }

    .stat-row span:last-child {
      color: #eaeaea;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* 下一个方块预览 */
    #next {
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #0f0f1a;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    /* 按钮 */
    button {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0f0f1a;
      background: #4ecca3;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    button:hover { background: #5fd9b3; transform: translateY(-1px); }
    button:active { transform: translateY(0); }

    /* 操作说明 */
    .help {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #7f8fa6;
    }

    .help kbd {
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 20px;
      padding: 1px 6px;
      background: #2d2d44;
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: #eaeaea;
      font-family: monospace;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* 游戏结束遮罩 */
    .overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: none;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .overlay.show { display: flex; }

    .overlay-content {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 60px;
      background: #16213e;
      border: 2px solid #4ecca3;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .overlay-content h1 {
      font-size: 36px;
      color: #ff6b6b;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .overlay-content p {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      color: #b8c1cc;
    }

    .overlay-content .final-score {
      font-size: 48px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #4ecca3;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="game-container">
    <!-- 游戏主画布 -->
    <canvas id="board" width="300" height="600"></canvas>

    <!-- 侧边栏 -->
    <div class="sidebar">
      <!-- 计分板 -->
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>得分</h2>
        <div class="score-value" id="score">0</div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h2>统计</h2>
        <div class="stat-row"><span>等级</span><span id="level">1</span></div>
        <div class="stat-row"><span>消行</span><span id="lines">0</span></div>
        <div class="stat-row"><span>最高分</span><span id="highscore">0</span></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 下一个方块 -->
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>下一个</h2>
        <canvas id="next" width="120" height="120"></canvas>
      </div>

      <button id="restart">重新开始</button>

      <!-- 操作说明 -->
      <div class="panel help">
        <kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd> 左右移动<br>
        <kbd>↓</kbd> 加速下落<br>
        <kbd>↑</kbd> 旋转<br>
        <kbd>空格</kbd> 直接落底<br>
        <kbd>P</kbd> 暂停 / 继续
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 游戏结束遮罩 -->
  <div class="overlay" id="overlay">
    <div class="overlay-content">
      <h1>游戏结束</h1>
      <p>最终得分</p>
      <span class="final-score" id="finalScore">0</span>
      <button id="playAgain">再来一局</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="game.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

